        "title": "The picture shows the map of a University Sports Centre in 2007 and at present. Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GR6WdkEKkohg1bxxpdulTRXmgWb\"><em><strong>The picture shows the map of a University Sports Centre in 2007 and at present. Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - University Sports Centre Changes: 2007 vs Present Day</em></p>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0nNdqrxtoU9EGxkGvml6QHzgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QxWPdDnfdod2NixZJAjlLYzqgGb\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\">&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QxWPdDnfdod2NixZJAjlLYzqgGb\">Đề b&agrave;i <em>University Sports Centre Changes: 2007 vs Present Day</em> y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả về bố cục của một trung t&acirc;m thể thao đại học ở hai thời điểm: năm 2007 v&agrave; hiện tại.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QxWPdDnfdod2NixZJAjlLYzqgGb\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QxWPdDnfdod2NixZJAjlLYzqgGb\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DQntd3hjzoNCjwxOfz4lvHOcgbb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N9LhdhEVXoJnGNxJPvyl0YZPg9e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-KGfkdvXnMo9tBVxWubvlf0gagVh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TOoQd6oJTo25Hhxi84tlE4FPgnb\"><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề&nbsp;<em>University Sports Centre Changes: 2007 vs Present Day</em> với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: những thay đổi ở trung t&acirc;m thể thao đại học - giữa năm 2007 v&agrave; hiện tại&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WTQ0dwsgtot3Mux4ZXOl05hSgTH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AmqcddMWAotWQFxJT6xl8CElghf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RKcrd7u17ogCsex6cUPlJ2cCgkh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-U7iadbsa0o9CMOxYDBClUkAhgse\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề map, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ tập trung n&oacute;i về c&aacute;c sự thay đổi ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AZYodOsfSod6E5xJw0Flch6wgZd\" data-list=\"bullet\">Trung t&acirc;m thể thao đ&atilde; trải qua qu&aacute; tr&igrave;nh mở rộng v&agrave; hiện đại h&oacute;a đ&aacute;ng kể</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AZYodOsfSod6E5xJw0Flch6wgZd\" data-list=\"bullet\">Số lượng teaching facilities đ&atilde; tăng hơn gấp đ&ocirc;i, v&agrave; nhiều tiện nghi mới đ&atilde; được bổ sung, bao gồm running track ở ph&iacute;a bắc v&agrave; <em>c&aacute;c cơ sở y tế (medical facilities) </em>ở ph&iacute;a nam.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch gom c&aacute;c sự thay đổi dựa tr&ecirc;n ti&ecirc;u ch&iacute; về mặt địa l&yacute; (từ Bắc xuống Nam):</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CpWhdSGJFoye2PxbbFelCRADg5e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FKLxd8T0jomlW3xlEQ5lfJGxgwb\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> Khu vực ph&iacute;a Bắc v&agrave; Trung t&acirc;m</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xz8Sd3833oJVsmxgnsUlprJUgUb\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xz8Sd3833oJVsmxgnsUlprJUgUb\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Vw50dZaq3oF2ZIxm3TBlq500gRe\">(Step 1) <strong>M&ocirc; tả sự n&acirc;ng cấp của s&acirc;n b&oacute;ng đ&aacute;:</strong></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JUA4dxEvgohR9ZxnhsblIGlIgJf\" data-list=\"bullet\"><em>S&acirc;n b&oacute;ng đ&aacute; (football pitch)</em>,&nbsp;nằm ở <em>vị tr&iacute; cực bắc (northernmost part) </em>của trung t&acirc;m, đ&atilde; được n&acirc;ng cấp từ<em> s&acirc;n cỏ tự nhi&ecirc;n (grass surface)</em> th&agrave;nh <em>s&acirc;n chơi mọi thời tiết (all-weather pitch)</em></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MlX8dHCreoaAIXx2VHXlgT9ugNh\">(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả đường chạy mới:</strong></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-D5hBdcWaxoptvfxYWxgl49IDgzd\" data-list=\"bullet\">Ngay ph&iacute;a dưới s&acirc;n b&oacute;ng, một <em>đường chạy bộ mới (running track)</em> đ&atilde; được x&acirc;y dựng, c&aacute;i m&agrave;<em> trước đ&acirc;y kh&ocirc;ng c&oacute; (did not exist in the original layout)</em></li>\n</ul>\n<p>(Step 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả thay đổi của hồ bơi v&agrave; s&acirc;n tennis:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><em>Hồ bơi (swimming pool)</em> vẫn giữ nguy&ecirc;n vị tr&iacute; ban đầu ở <em>ph&iacute;a t&acirc;y (western side)</em>, trong khi <em>s&acirc;n tennis ngay b&ecirc;n cạnh (adjacent tennis court)</em> đ&atilde; được thay thế bằng <em>s&acirc;n b&oacute;ng quần (squash court)</em></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P28wdkqCxoxJzCxhGfIlLa1cgwd\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">&nbsp;BODY</span><strong> 2: Teaching facilities v&agrave; c&aacute;c cơ sở y tế mới ở ph&iacute;a Nam</strong></span></h4>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EwzTddSWRoqDSGxM4hFlvPg1grc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OrA9dgGjNoRCVUxfgJ1lOWFlglh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OrA9dgGjNoRCVUxfgJ1lOWFlglh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IkHudzeJ4oBsktxrxaeld0Dcgvb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">(Step 1)<strong> M&ocirc; tả t&igrave;nh trạng năm 2007 v&agrave; sự mở rộng của teaching facilities hiện tại:</strong></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P4tHdz1hUolSqWxwKZrl2KT7g8t\" data-list=\"bullet\">Năm 2007, chỉ c&oacute; 20 <em>ph&ograve;ng học (teaching rooms)</em> ở khu trung t&acirc;m, c&ugrave;ng với c&aacute;c <em>nh&agrave; dạy học tạm thời (temporary teaching huts)</em> ở <em>r&igrave;a ph&iacute;a đ&ocirc;ng (eastern edge)</em> của khu phức hợp</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P4tHdz1hUolSqWxwKZrl2KT7g8t\" data-list=\"bullet\">Đến hiện tại, số lượng teaching facilities đ&atilde; tăng đ&aacute;ng kể l&ecirc;n 47 ph&ograve;ng, v&agrave; c&aacute;c nh&agrave; dạy học tạm thời đ&atilde; được dỡ bỏ</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NtzkdMhGco10OhxizWKlFrxEgSb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả c&aacute;c cơ sở y tế mới ở ph&iacute;a Nam:</strong></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P4tHdz1hUolSqWxwKZrl2KT7g8t\" data-list=\"bullet\"><em>Ranh giới ph&iacute;a nam (southern boundary)</em> của trung t&acirc;m hiện c&oacute; th&ecirc;m nhiều cơ sở mới, bao gồm <em>ph&ograve;ng sơ cứu (first aid room)</em>, <em>ph&ograve;ng kh&aacute;m (clinic)</em>, <em>ph&ograve;ng th&iacute; nghiệm (laboratory)</em>, v&agrave;<em> t&ograve;a&nbsp;giảng dạy&nbsp;2 tầng (two-storeyed teaching building)</em>, <em>những thứ m&agrave; trước đ&acirc;y kh&ocirc;ng c&oacute; (none of which existed in the earlier layout)</em></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 3141,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LNavdagjrozCSoxHEnWlEU0ZgNc\">The two maps illustrate the changes that have taken place at a university sports centre between 2007 and the present day.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 41518,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 3142,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NJHQdSAxboYtmExdnjnlwCeKgP9\">Overall, the sports centre has undergone significant expansion and modernisation over this period. Most notably, the teaching facilities have more than doubled in number, and several new amenities have been added, including a running track in the north and medical facilities in the south.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 41518,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 3143,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<p>Regarding the northern and central areas, the football pitch, which occupied the northernmost part of the centre in 2007, has been upgraded from a grass surface to an all-weather pitch. Directly below it, a new running track has been constructed, which did not exist in the original layout. Moving southward, while the swimming pool has remained in its original position on the western side, the adjacent tennis court has been replaced by a squash court.</p>",
            "question_id": 41518,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 3144,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<p>As for the teaching and support facilities, in 2007, there were only 20 teaching rooms in the central block, along with temporary teaching huts on the eastern edge of the complex. By the present day, the number of teaching facilities has increased dramatically to 47, and the temporary huts have been removed. Furthermore, the southern boundary of the centre now features several new additions, namely a first aid room, a clinic, a laboratory, and a two-storeyed teaching building, none of which existed in the earlier layout.</p>",
            "question_id": 41518,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          }
